graph TD
    %% Entry Point
    A[User/Browser] -->|HTTP Request| B(run.py - Flask Server)

    %% App Initialization
    B --> C{App Factory & Blueprints<br>(app/__init__.py)}
    C --> D[Route Resolver / URL Mapping]

    %% Authentication Gateway
    D --> E{Session Check<br>(session.get('user_id'))}
    
    E -->|No Active Session| F[Redirect to Login Page]
    F --> G[Auth Route: /login<br>(app/routes/auth/login.py)]
    G --> H{Validate Credentials}

    %% Auth Logic (Flawed as per README)
    H -->|Username: admin<br>Password: admin123| I[Set Admin Session]
    H -->|Check Principal Table| J[Set Principal Session<br>session['principal_id']]
    H -->|Check Teacher Table| K[Set Teacher Session]
    
    %% Role-Based Routing
    I --> L[Access Admin Blueprint<br>/admin/*]
    J --> M[Access Principal Blueprint<br>/principal/*]
    K --> N[Access Teacher Blueprint<br>/teacher/*]

    %% --- ADMIN FLOW ---
    subgraph Admin_Dashboard [Admin Pipeline]
        L --> L1[Dashboard View]
        L1 --> L2[Manage Principals]
        L2 --> L3[Add / Edit / Delete Principals<br>via WTForms]
    end

    %% --- PRINCIPAL FLOW ---
    subgraph Principal_Dashboard [Principal Pipeline]
        M --> M1[Dashboard View<br>(Shift Selection)]
        M1 --> M2[Manage Teachers]
        M1 --> M3[Manage Departments]
        M1 --> M4[Manage Subjects & Curriculum]
        M2 --> M5[Add / Edit / Delete Teachers]
        M3 --> M6[Add / Edit Departments]
        M4 --> M7[Assign Subjects to Department & Semester]
    end

    %% --- TEACHER FLOW ---
    subgraph Teacher_Dashboard [Teacher Pipeline]
        N --> N1[Dashboard View]
        N1 --> N2[Manage Students]
        N1 --> N3[Manage Attendance]
        N1 --> N4[Manage Marks Topics]
        N2 --> N5[Add / Edit / Delete Students]
        N3 --> N6[Record Daily Attendance<br>per Student]
        N4 --> N7[Record Marks per Topic / Student]
    end

    %% --- DATA LAYER (Unified) ---
    subgraph Data_Layer [Data & Persistence Layer]
        direction TB
        L3 --> O[SQLAlchemy Models<br>(app/models/*.py)]
        M5 --> O
        M6 --> O
        M7 --> O
        N5 --> O
        N6 --> O
        N7 --> O
        O --> P[(SQLite Database<br>database.db)]
    end

    %% --- RESPONSE LAYER ---
    subgraph Response_Layer [Response Rendering]
        direction TB
        P --> Q[Jinja2 Templates<br>(templates/)]
        Q --> R[Rendered HTML / Redirect]
        R --> S[HTTP Response]
        S --> A
    end

    %% Valid Session bypasses Login
    E -->|Valid Session Exists| L
    E -->|Valid Session Exists| M
    E -->|Valid Session Exists| N

    %% Styling
    classDef admin fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef principal fill:#bbf,stroke:#333;
    classDef teacher fill:#bfb,stroke:#333;
    class L,L1,L2,L3 admin;
    class M,M1,M2,M3,M4,M5,M6,M7 principal;
    class N,N1,N2,N3,N4,N5,N6,N7 teacher;